OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain or drizzle likely, but also
OL,7,Fplenty of drier intervals. Rain will
OL,8,Fgradually ease, to leave most parts
OL,9,Fdry by the afternoon. Some brighter
OL,10,Fintervals then possible. Winds
OL,11,Fremaining light throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud thickening again
OL,14,Fovernight, with light rain after
OL,15,Fmidnight, turning persistent for many.
OL,16,FPerhaps clearer and rather chilly
OL,17,Facross the far north, with a patchy
OL,18,Frural frost possible by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
