OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOvernight rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing southeast. A fine, dry day
OL,7,Ffollows with sunny spells.
OL,8,FTemperatures near normal for early
OL,9,FOctober, with a cool northerly breeze
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Perhaps the odd evening
OL,11,Fshower.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,14,Fday Thursday after a chilly start with
OL,15,Frural frost, before rain and stronger
OL,16,Fwinds spread east overnight. Windy
OL,17,FFriday and Saturday, with brighter
OL,18,Fspells but also outbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
